.antigravity/
graphify-out/
.agents/
docs/
artifacts/
AGENTS.md
.specify/
# Standalone academic report (unrelated to WAF project)
/report-case-tools/

# Kubernetes admin credentials — a kubeconfig carries a client private key and
# must never be committed (was tracked at containers/k8s/kubeconfig.yaml; see
# .gitleaks.toml entry 8). Ignore it and any other kubeconfig.
k8s/kubeconfig.yaml
**/kubeconfig*.yaml
*.kubeconfig

# Local scratch drafts (PRD / planning notes), never committed
.prd-*.md
